        "text": "Innate: Xayah's ability casts generate 3 stacks of Clean Cuts, lasting for 8 seconds, refreshing on subsequent casts, and stacking up to 5 times. Xayah's basic attacks are empowered to each consume a stack on-attack to instead shoot a Feather that deals the triggering attack's damage to the primary target and 35 / 45 / 55 (based on level)% AD physical damage to other enemies hit. The secondary target damage can critically strike for 200% damage if the triggering attack does.",
