      {
        "label": "Innate - Lover's Leap",
        "text": "Innate - Lover's Leap: If either Xayah or Rakan is channeling Recall, the other may move nearby and channel their own to join alongside them. Both reach base at the time of which the initiator's Recall completes.",
        "leveling": [],
