    "custom": [],
    "notes": [
      "Feathers will stop upon being intercepted by projectile-blocking effects.\n  - : Missile popping before and after striking the primary target.",
      "After striking their target, the attack will proceed in a line in the same direction it was already flying.\n  - If the target is more than 1000 units from Xayah when the empowered attack hits them, the attack will not keep flying in a line and drop the Feather at their location immediately.\n  - Unlike similar effects, the homing and line trajectories use the same missile.",
      "All her Feathers on the ground will be destroyed when Xayah dies, and while she is dead, missiles that are still in flight will not spawn new ones, either.",
      "The empowered attack will not trigger against structures nor wards.\n  - The duration will be refreshed when starting the attack windup against them.",
      "The number of Clean Cuts stacks available is represented by a feather counter in her ammo bar, visible to the player only."
